cookbook/references/index.md:27:- [[kaggriculture-encoder-reuses-isaiah-stateless-layers|Kaggriculture encoder reuses Isaiah's stateless layers]] — The rebuilt encoder uses Isaiah's StatelessTransformerV1 classes, token roles, packing, compile hook and initialization; only stem input widths are game-specific, and guards chunk both the padded and packed compiled GEMMs below 2^31. Describes the current tree; registration and the masked critic are in the Task 3.1 model-side Reference.
