cookbook/decisions/restart-the-port-from-isaiahs-clean-base.md:130:Isaiah's critical pins are unchanged: torch 2.9.0, triton 3.5.0, flash-attn 2.8.3, numpy, pydantic, wandb, mypy. The other 55 changed dependency names (plus the `owl` requirement record) are kaggle-environments' own dependency tree (e.g. jax 0.10 → 0.11.2; `click` is shared with W&B, whose live telemetry was not exercised). Checks with 1.32.7: `just prepare` passes, with Rust 155 passed / 2 ignored (expensive action-angle audits; Orbit replay and generation parity pass) and Python 722 passed / 3 skipped. Codex independently reproduced the lock byte-for-byte from the recorded `uv remove` + `uv add` (`ops/deps-independent-verification-fb65e1f/`).
